# Architecture

- Packages: `network`, `telemetry`, `quality`, `powerflow`, `anomaly`, `pipeline`, `ui`, `config`.
- Pandapower types and calls live only behind `network/` and `powerflow/`. Other packages use domain types.
- Network loader is pluggable: `load_network(name_or_path=...)`; default `case14`.
- Quality gate is the sole PF authorizer. Pipeline orchestrates; UI reads Stage 6 JSONL/events only — no second pipeline.
- Anomaly MVP is measurement faults; keep event-type room for future `pf_residual` without implementing residual detectors yet.
